{"track":"python","id":"py-006","category":"문자열·리스트","level":2,"title":"단어 순서 뒤집기","desc":"<p>공백으로 구분된 문장에서 <b>단어의 순서</b>를 뒤집는 <code>reverse_words(sentence)</code>를 만드세요.</p>\n<p>예: <code>\"hello world\"</code> → <code>\"world hello\"</code></p>","starter":"def reverse_words(sentence):\n    pass\n","solution":"def reverse_words(sentence):\n    words = sentence.split()\n    return \" \".join(reversed(words))\n","hint":"<p><code>split()</code>으로 단어 리스트를 만들고, 뒤집은 뒤 <code>\" \".join(...)</code>으로 다시 합쳐요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"reverse_words(\"hello world\")","expected":"world hello","visible":true},{"call":"reverse_words(\"a b c\")","expected":"c b a","visible":true},{"call":"reverse_words(\"single\")","expected":"single","visible":false},{"call":"reverse_words(\"one two three four\")","expected":"four three two one","visible":false}]}